# Fastmail via IMAPS. Requires an app password (Fastmail → Settings →
# Password & Security → App passwords) with IMAP scope.

IMAPAccount fastmail
Host ${MAIL_HOST}
Port ${MAIL_PORT}
User ${MAIL_USER}
PassCmd "echo $MAIL_PASSWORD"
SSLType ${MAIL_SSL}
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore fastmail-remote
Account fastmail

MaildirStore fastmail-local
Path /var/mail/
Inbox /var/mail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel fastmail
Far :fastmail-remote:
Near :fastmail-local:
Patterns ${MAIL_FOLDERS}
Create Near
Sync Pull
Expunge None
SyncState *
MaxMessages ${MAIL_MAX_MESSAGES}
MaxSize ${MAIL_MAX_SIZE}
